  "Question": "The diagonals \\(AC\\) and \\(BD\\) of parallelogram \\(ABCD\\) intersect at point \\(O\\). Given \\(AC=10\\), \\(BD=14\\), and \\(AB=6\\), find the perimeter of \\(\\triangle OAB\\).",
